                "opened": true,
                "quote_verbatim": true,
                "note": "Quote by Benjamin Larsson (2025-02-09). Greg KH said removing COMPILE_TEST was not the right fix; Larsson removed it anyway. Greg's 'enable OF' remark is a guess; he is not named as the tty maintainer on the page."
              },
              {
