                "note": "Re-opened. Title 'Arch-specific unit's constraints are invalidly(?) satisfiable', opened 2026-08-16, still open. Maintainer replied 2026-08-18 that ps3disk.o should not be buildable in x86 because klocalizer analyses one architecture at a time, and listed three possible fixes. Reporter said 2026-08-22 they use kmax to generate minimized configs for testing patches. The 'omitted the option' detail from the dossier was not confirmed. Cite by issue number only.",
