                "quote_verbatim": true,
                "note": "Verified: 'an upgrade is only necessary for those who have observed a build failure with the 6.12.75, 6.6.128, or 6.1.165 kernels'; regression reported by Peter Schneider; no cause given; article does not itself call them build-fix releases (summarizer-read)."
              },
