              "claim": "Hovold's k3-socinfo fix: the driver's Kconfig symbol had no input prompt, so it could not be selected even for compile testing; patch sent 2025-11-27, a maintainer was still being asked to pick it up on 2026-01-14. Root cause is a Kconfig defect (outside kfold); the symptom (object unbuildable under every selectable config) is object-level.",
              "quote": "enable that by adding the missing input prompt.",
              "url": "https://lkml.iu.edu/hypermail/linux/kernel/2601.1/11851.html",
              "date": "2026-01-14",
              "evidence_type": "anecdote",
              "source_group": "Hovold compile-testing patch series 2025-26",
              "reopened_and_verified": true
