            {
              "claim": "Maintainers Summit 2025 linux-next session (LWN report by Corbet): Torvalds finds basic configurations untested and some repositories get no testing. The LWN text paraphrases that allmodconfig builds disable some code and can hide problems; that clause is Corbet's wording, not a verified Torvalds quote. Ojeda did not want canned configurations used.",
              "quote": "basic configurations just haven't been tested",
              "url": "https://lwn.net/Articles/1050027/",
              "date": "2025-12-12",
