              "claim": "Same bug at introduction: the Kconfig symbol was LEDS_OSRAM_AMS_AS3668 but the Makefile line used CONFIG_LEDS_AS3668. Author date 2026-01-18, so about 97 days between the authoring dates of the driver and the fix (merge dates not checked).",
              "quote": "+obj-$(CONFIG_LEDS_AS3668)\t\t+= leds-as3668.o",
              "url": "https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/c7dd343a3756.patch",
