              "claim": "Kconfirm (Braha) is an active Kconfig-side checker: dead code, constant conditions, invalid ranges; 1282 alarms on x86-64 at v7.2-rc4 with default checks. Its cover letter says nothing about Makefiles. GitHub commit search shows 38 mainline commits citing it by 2026-10-17 (not curated).",
