              "tool_or_process": "scripts/checkkconfigsymbols.py",
              "what_it_does": "Greps all tracked files (Makefiles included, as plain text) for CONFIG_ references and reports symbols never defined in a Kconfig file; options -c, -d, -f, -i, -s. Python rewrite 2014-09-27.",
              "limits": "Text match only: no notion of Makefile variables, directory guards, conjunctions, or unsatisfiability. Misses defined-but-unsatisfiable guards and orphan composites. Bugs it should flag (as3668, gpib) were found by other means after 1-3 months. Not shown to run in CI.",
              "url": "https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/scripts/checkkconfigsymbols.py"
