                "note": "Confirms klocalizer/koverage/kismet functions, per-run architecture selection, multiple configs when both #ifdef arms change; no whole-tree cover described. Summarizer paraphrase partly; only short strings quoted.",
                "quote_verbatim": true
              },
              {
                "url": "https://sigops.org/s/conferences/sosp/2011/workshops/plos/02-tartler.pdf",
                "opened": false,
                "note": "Not re-opened in this pass; relies on dossier (marked reopened earlier). Treat figures as unverified here.",
                "quote_verbatim": false
