              "reopened_and_verified": true
            },
            {
              "claim": "ChromeOS kernel config guide: shared options must be edited in every flavour (the example family has 6 flavours, 3 ARM and 3 Intel), and a miss gives a silent no-op. The older dossier figure of about 10 flavours is wrong for this page.",
              "quote": "If you miss one, then the result may be no change, which can be very confusing.",
              "url": "https://www.chromium.org/chromium-os/developer-library/guides/kernel/kernel-configuration/",
              "date": "current docs (n.d.)",
              "evidence_type": "anecdote",
