              "reopened_and_verified": true
            },
            {
              "claim": "Fedora/RHEL kernel-ark reviews new Kconfig symbols one directory at a time. The bot MRs are still being opened in Oct 2026 (MR 4778 lists one symbol, REFCOUNT_INTERRUPT_KUNIT_TEST). Reviewers ACK files added to the ark hierarchy, so the review unit is the symbol and its value, with no view of which objects it brings in.",
              "quote": "The final options that need to be ACKed are the files that are being added to the ark hierarchy.",
              "url": "https://gitlab.com/cki-project/kernel-ark/-/merge_requests/3665",
              "date": "2025-01-30 (MR 3665); MR 4778 opened 2026-10-05",
              "evidence_type": "policy",
