              "claim": "Debian wishlist bug #1112317, 2025-08-28: a request to enable the new GPIB driver family (one built-in core plus five modules). Same pattern, no reply visible on the page. Together with the DLN2 bug it shows that driver-enable requests are routine, but not that maintainers lack a tool for them.",
              "quote": "please consider enabling the GPIB interface drivers for older measurement devices.",
              "url": "https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1112317",
