            {
              "claim": "LPC 2025 Build Systems MC (Garmin, Joshua Watt): downstream SBOM work aims to drop vulnerability reports that do not match compiled source code or build-time configured features. This is a stated downstream demand, and the page gives no Kbuild method.",
              "quote": "discarding vulnerabilities that do not match compiled source code, or even build time configured features",
              "url": "https://lpc.events/event/19/contributions/2020/",
