            {
              "claim": "Buildman documents the idea of mapping changed files to the boards that build them only as unfinished work. Its documented selection options work on board attributes (-x, --boards, -n/-v), not on files. Operator-level admission that the file-to-configuration mapping is missing for U-Boot.",
              "quote": "checking commits for changed files and building only boards which use those files",
              "url": "https://docs.u-boot-project.org/en/latest/build/buildman.html",
