            "syzbot ci production: 9 fuzz targets, all with kernel_config upstream-apparmor-kasan.config (syz-cluster global-config.yaml, master 2026-10-17).",
            "syzbot ci LLM config step: workflow added 2026-06-02, wired into builds 2026-06-09, name validation 2026-06-19; time limit 1 hour and 5M-token limit per evaluation (from ai.go as read through the fetch tool).",
            "syzkaller dashboard/config/linux: 93 generated .config files at top level; subsystems.yml about 541 options (fetch tool tally); main.yml lists about 45 upstream-* and other instances.",
            "syzbot LPC 2023: about 25 syzkaller instances, 150-200 VMs; patch-test requests rose from about 300 (2018) to about 1,000/year (2021-22) (values read from a bar chart in the earlier dossier; not re-read).",
